Package: libatspi2.0-0
Version: @DEB_ATSPI2_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/at-spi2-core
Depends: libglib2.0-0, dbus
Description: Assistive Technology Service Provider Interface - client library
 libatspi is the D-Bus client library for the AT-SPI accessibility protocol.
 Screen readers and other assistive tools use it to inspect and drive
 applications.
